			"notes": "More things! Yay!\n\n**Features**\n- Added game history / statistics menus for Battle Box, Battle Box Arena, and Sky Battle Solos! This allows you to see past matches, including your kills, assists, deaths, round wins/losses, placement, score... everything! This also includes an overall stats box at the top of the menu which shows you your best map and kits based on win rate and KDR, as well as a breakdown of different kill/death sources!\n- Added compact XP info window, shrinking down the UI by cutting unneccessary text. This should hopefully alleviate it filling 50% of the screen sometimes!!...\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Enabling XP Breakdown on the XP window no longer resets to disabled when the window updates\n- Fixed some of MCC Island's GUI textures sometimes failing to load\n- Fixed crash when closing style perks menu with X button\n- OOBE has had some tiny fixes, one of which being that the setup process now ends whenever the Style Perks menu is closed by any means, and not just by pressing Esc\n\nJust to let all of you know, feature updates will probably be slowing down from now on. I've been working on this project for over 2 months straight without much time to try other things and... it's starting to get really monotonous 😭\n\nOf course, if any critical bugs are found, I'll make sure to update the mod to fix those, and in the future I may add a few new features here and there, but for now... I wanna make other things!!!\n\nAs always, thanks for using Galapagos! Happy trophy hunting! 🐢 (And happy event fishing too :3 🐙)"
		},
